  "description": "Test support for apps built on Deskling.Core and Deskling.Companion, mirrored from the Swift DesklingTesting: mock clock, idle, busy and random sources; conformance helpers (finding the vectors folder, dates, names); the replay bodies that check an app's companion vectors (phrases, settings, picker, cadence, quiet timelines, character poses, desktop) and return their problems; loaders for Deskling's fixture bank, defaults and art; fakes for the companion shell (speaker, chime, timers run by hand). No test framework dependency.",
